# ===========================
# 🛡️ LIBRARY SAFETY
# ===========================
# 1. First, lock the door: Ignore accidental drags of books into the root
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi

# 2. Then, open specific doors: Allow these files ONLY inside the Hub's Inbox
!buddhist-contributions-hub/Inbox/**/*.pdf
!buddhist-contributions-hub/Inbox/**/*.epub
!buddhist-contributions-hub/Inbox/**/*.mobi

# Allow MDs in Contributions
!Contributions/**/*.md